    added = {
      "2.6.95 fixes the Randomizer rival-sync diagnostic closure/order bug that caused NUZ RULES to fail Release Safety at runtime. Gameplay/randomizer mappings are unchanged; runtime retest is required.",
      "2.6.93 repairs the stale World Building catalog golden that blocked MOD MANAGER startup in 2.6.92; the approved 104-key snapshot now reports explicit missing/unexpected key drift before checksum failure. Runtime confirmation remains required.",
